WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.500
Prince of Jin, forgive us our offense!

00:10.680 --> 00:13.000
What did you say?! The Prince of Jin cannot be found?!

00:12.920 --> 00:16.200
This servant inquired across the city, but no one knows His Highness's whereabouts!

00:16.440 --> 00:20.000
What of my father's manor? The Minister's estate has already been surrounded by imperial troops!

00:20.240 --> 00:24.000
Disaster! Princess, soldiers are marching straight toward our residence!

00:26.960 --> 00:31.000
Ah Da, find a way to stall the troops outside!
